// // Canonical root hashing stdlib for Kain.
// //
// // This module is intentionally target-neutral Kain source: deterministic
// // 32-bit word mixing, byte-fed FNV-1a, CRC32 byte folding, and fingerprint
// // combinators that are useful to capsules, caches, wire formats, benchmarks,
// // and compiler/runtime proof blades without depending on host string layout.
