// // Root Python surface for Kain.
// //
// // This is the generic low-level lane for embedded Python interop.
// //
// // Package access should come through first-class `import ...` in authored Kain.
// // `use std::python` exists for explicit bridge calls, module checks, and
// // controlled materialization between live Python objects and Kain-owned data.
